WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.634 --> 00:00:03.069
-Guys, as I said before, this
week, the U.N. General Assembly

00:00:03.069 --> 00:00:05.638
with leaders coming in from
all over the world is happening.

00:00:05.638 --> 00:00:07.239
They're gonna give speeches.
They're gonna meet each other.

00:00:07.239 --> 00:00:09.008
But sometimes, when
you meet new people,

00:00:09.008 --> 00:00:10.777
it can be hard to break the ice,

00:00:10.777 --> 00:00:12.245
which is why a lot
of leaders come prepared

00:00:12.245 --> 00:00:14.880
with their very own "getting
to know you" icebreakers.

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:16.049
I'll show you what I mean.

00:00:16.049 --> 00:00:18.617
It's time for
"Tonight Show Icebreakers."

00:00:18.617 --> 00:00:24.290
-♪ "Tonight Show Icebreakers" ♪

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:28.661
-First up, we have British
Prime Minister Boris Johnson.

00:00:28.661 --> 00:00:31.897 line:0%
His icebreaker is, "Which fork
do you use to comb your hair?"

00:00:31.897 --> 00:00:33.800 line:0%
[ Laughter ]
Yeah, yeah.

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.467 line:0%
A nice icebreaker.

00:00:35.467 --> 00:00:36.903 line:0%
Gets you into the conversation.

00:00:36.903 --> 00:00:40.974 line:0%
Next up, we have
Latvian President Egils Levits.

00:00:40.974 --> 00:00:43.109 line:0%
His icebreaker is,
"Hi, my friends call me

00:00:43.109 --> 00:00:45.678 line:0%
'Latvian Wolf Blitzer.'"

00:00:45.678 --> 00:00:47.179 line:0%
-Good one.
-It's just icebreaking.

00:00:47.179 --> 00:00:48.747 line:0%
-Yeah, just break the ice.

00:00:48.747 --> 00:00:52.785 line:0%
-Next up, is
Finnish President Niinisto.

00:00:52.785 --> 00:00:55.521 line:0%
His icebreaker is, "Sorry,
you might not recognize me

00:00:55.521 --> 00:00:58.757 line:0%
without my Joker makeup."

00:00:58.757 --> 00:01:00.226 line:0%
That's interesting.
It's an icebreaker.

00:01:00.226 --> 00:01:01.427 line:0%
-Yeah.

00:01:01.427 --> 00:01:05.297 line:0%
-Here is Prime Minister
Bennett of Israel.

00:01:05.297 --> 00:01:08.901 line:0%
His icebreaker is, "Do you like
my resting kissy face?"

00:01:08.901 --> 00:01:12.338 line:0%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:12.338 --> 00:01:15.508 line:0%
-[ Smooching ]

00:01:15.508 --> 00:01:18.043 line:0%
-Up next, here is
U.S. President Joe Biden.

00:01:18.043 --> 00:01:19.612 line:0%
-Oh.
-His icebreaker is,

00:01:19.612 --> 00:01:21.047 line:0%
"You remind me
of my buddy, Jasper.

00:01:21.047 --> 00:01:23.883 line:0%
He invented the wheel."

00:01:23.883 --> 00:01:26.519 line:0%
-That's his icebreaker?

00:01:26.519 --> 00:01:28.054 line:0%
Wow.

00:01:28.054 --> 00:01:31.324 line:0%
-Next is Estonian President
Kaljulaid.

00:01:31.324 --> 00:01:33.693 line:0%
Her icebreaker is,
"You appear weak.

00:01:33.693 --> 00:01:35.360 line:0%
I bore of this."

00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:37.563 line:0%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:38.664 --> 00:01:41.767 line:0%
next up, we have
Prime Minister Modi of India.

00:01:41.767 --> 00:01:44.236 line:0%
His icebreaker is, "Why does
Macy's keep offering me

00:01:44.236 --> 00:01:46.405 line:0%
a part-time job
for the holidays?"

00:01:46.405 --> 00:01:48.141 line:0%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:48.141 --> 00:01:50.876 line:0%
-That's a good icebreaker.
-Yeah.

00:01:50.876 --> 00:01:54.980 line:0%
And finally, here is Brazilian
President Jair Bolsonaro.

00:01:54.980 --> 00:01:57.583 line:0%
His icebreaker is,
"I'm unvaxxed, sashed,

00:01:57.583 --> 00:01:59.719 line:0%
and ready to get trashed."

00:01:59.719 --> 00:02:01.721 line:0%
That's all we have for
"Tonight Show Icebreakers."

